        ":native_py",
        "@pypi//astor",
        "@pypi//typer",
    ],
)

# ── Generated Python modules ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The six aux grammars whose generated modules the package imports at runtime.  All of them
# use :genparser_stage0, because :genparser transitively imports the very modules these
# targets produce (gsm2parser_rs -> regex_parser, ast_config -> fltkast_parser, plumbing ->
# unparsefmt_parser + fltklsp_parser).
#
# out_dir puts the outputs at their Python package paths under the root package.  A
# fltk/fegen/BUILD.bazel would let each grammar own its own targets, but it would also cut the
# root package's fltk/** globs off at that directory, so the targets live here instead.
aux_generate_parsers(gen_tool = ":genparser_stage0")

